<opsproc code="00017833.0001001" revdate="2015-11-03T23:40:42"><title>ACCU PRESS Indicator (with WHEEL SD page)</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.001"><title>During cockpit preparation</title><procbody lid="N.00017833.0001001.002"><action-block lid="N.00017833.0001001.003"><action layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.004" memory="false"><cr-action code="00017833.0001001.001"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ENG 2 PUMP</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.005" memory="false"><cr-action code="00017833.0001001.002"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">YELLOW ELEC PUMP</tech-label></challenge><response>Off</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.006" memory="false"><command code="00017833.0001001.003"><para layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.007">Move a side stick in pitch and
roll until the yellow system pressure indication on the <tech-label type="s-page">HYD </tech-label> indicates 0.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.008" memory="false"><cr-action code="00017833.0001001.004"><challenge><tech-label type="handle">PARK BRK</tech-label></challenge><response>ON</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.009" memory="false"><cr-action code="00017833.0001001.005"><challenge><tech-label type="indicator">BRAKES pressure</tech-label></challenge><response>CHECK</response></cr-action><comment code="00017833.0001001.006"><para layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.010">On the <tech-label type="s-page">WHEEL</tech-label>, check that the ACCU PRESS or ACCU ONLY indication is displayed
in green. If required, use the electric pump on the yellow hydraulic
system to recharge the brake accumulators.</para><warning code="00017833.0001001.007" layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.011"><para layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.012">Yellow and green hydraulics
systems are pressurized from yellow electric pump.</para><para layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.013">Get ground crew clearance
before using the electric pump.</para></warning></comment></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.014" memory="false"><command code="00017833.0001001.008"><para layer="1" lid="N.00017833.0001001.015">Restore normal settings.</para></command></action></action-block></procbody></procitem></opsproc>